ull,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-07-20T18:29:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T18:23:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.8.dev custom build [db01b4f730819cb39bce1922a7ec377b18239c0f], 4.7.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.stable - Android 12 (SDK 31 build 058002B000052002813269650) - Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated Adreno (TM) 650 -  (8 threads) - Android (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen calling a Java method through `JavaClassWrapper`, a `null` cannot be passed to a `String` / `CharSequence` parameter, even though Java `String` is a nullable object. The same wrapper **does** accept `null` for object (class) parameters, so the behavior is asymmetric.\n\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"1644\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f51bff7-9bf8-4782-89ef-ab6f711192a2\" />\n\n**Expected behavior**: passing `null` to a `String` / `CharSequence` argument passes Java `null`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the attached MRP and run it on an Android device.\n2. Read `adb logcat -s godot`. The call\n\n   ```gdscript\n   var Uri := JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"android.net.Uri\")\n   Uri.parse(null)   # null to a single String argument\n   ```\n\nfails with **`Cannot convert argument 1 from Nil to String`** (verified on an Android device), even though `Uri.parse(String)` accepts null on the Java side.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30200035/mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null}